# UI/UX master skill (mandatory for matching UI work)

Before creating, editing, reviewing, auditing, or redesigning a UI, read
`.agents/skills/ui-ux-design-master/SKILL.md` in full and follow it. This includes
responsive/mobile behavior, accessibility, design tokens, platform conventions,
Arabic RTL, i18n, and the pre-delivery checklist.

Do not treat this pointer as a replacement for the full skill. If it is unavailable,
state that limitation.
